        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Glynn Johnson 100 Series Concealed Overhead Holder / Stop </b>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>The Glynn Johnson 100 series </b>is ideal for use on entrance and vestibule doors, large doors, doors opened frequently, or doors subject to abuse. These models are also furnished with an offset-style jamb bracket. Designed for heavy-duty applications, long-lasting protection to doors, frames, hinges, related hardware and surrounding walls or obstructions. \r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Hold Open </b><br>\r\nHold-Open models provide a convenient method of holding the door open at a predetermined position for short or long periods of time, permitting an unobstructed traffic flow through the opening. These models are both selective and adjustable. They feature a control knob which protrudes from the face of the door and turns the hold-open function on or off. Set in the inactive position, the unit acts as a stop and shock absorber. The tension on the hold-open mechanism can be adjusted using a phillips screwdriver to offset air currents or other exterior conditions. The hold-open tension adjustment is located on the bottom of the track in the top of the door.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Internal Hold-Open</b><br>\r\nThese models provide a hold-open unit with the hold-open mechanism built into the channel, thus reducing the door prep. The 100HP have a preset hold-open force that is not adjustable. The hold-open feature is not selectable in these units, so the doors are always held open.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Friction Hold-Open</b><br>\r\nFriction hold-open models provide an alternative holding method, ideal for heavy patient room doors, closet doors or similar applications where multiple hold-open positions are desired. \r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Stop Only</b><br>\r\nIf the hold-open function is not required, the stop-only function provides the same effective door control minus the hold-open feature. May be used on fire doors. \r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/gly-100-series-2.jpg?v=1704354508\">\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Concealed</b> track mounts to a metal doors top rail or mortised into top of wood doors.\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Glynn Johnson 100 Series Heavy-Duty Surface Concealed Overhead Holder / Stop",
                "description": "The Glynn Johnson 100 series is ideal for use on entrance and vestibule doors, large doors, doors opened frequently, or doors subject to abuse. These models are also furnished with an offset-style jamb bracket. Designed for heavy-duty applications, long-lasting protection to doors, frames, hinges, related hardware and surrounding walls or obstructions. ",
